WEBVTT

00:01:26.899 --> 00:01:30.903
"Chapter 6 - Velvet Crowe"

00:01:38.745 --> 00:01:39.996
Oscar...

00:01:46.252 --> 00:01:48.796
So, it's you, Seres.

00:01:49.005 --> 00:01:54.802
| can't believe they sent you, one of the best
Praetor-class Exorcists, to this island.

00:01:55.011 --> 00:01:59.891
It just shows how important
this matter is to Lord Artorius.

00:02:00.099 --> 00:02:05.480
What I can't believe is that you,
a Malak, betrayed Lord Artorius.

00:02:05.688 --> 00:02:07.065
| am surprised.

00:02:14.364 --> 00:02:17.950
And you must be the Daemoneater.

00:02:18.159 --> 00:02:21.621
| will take your ship and strike Artorius down.

00:02:26.042 --> 00:02:28.336
Those words deserve a thousand deaths.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:41.140
Can you withstand my blade of exorcism,
given to me by Lord Artorius himself?

00:02:42.266 --> 00:02:46.312
You may be a Daemoneater, but you
are a woman. I will treat you respectfully--

00:02:58.658 --> 00:03:01.202
| will treat you as an insolent Daemon.

00:03:05.707 --> 00:03:12.964
| am Oscar Dragonia, Praetor-class Exorcist
of the Abbey of the Holy Midgand Empire.

00:03:13.172 --> 00:03:16.801
By the order of Lord Artorius,
| place you under arrest!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:30.291
Like a beast. But now that I am here,
you have no chance of winning.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.337
Your savagery almost
made me forget why I am here.

00:04:34.545 --> 00:04:39.383
| did not come all the way
to the end of the world to kill you.

00:04:39.592 --> 00:04:42.303
You will go back to your prison.

00:04:42.512 --> 00:04:47.767
Your task is to continue
eating Daemons, Daemoneater.

00:04:47.975 --> 00:04:52.814
The only reason why I live is to kill that man.

00:04:53.022 --> 00:04:59.946
| ate Daemons every day... for whatever reason.

00:05:00.154 --> 00:05:03.241
If you hate us for that, then you are wrong.

00:05:03.449 --> 00:05:08.371
That is your role, the law and
order established by the world.

00:05:09.997 --> 00:05:13.501
Just like how my little brother was sacrificed?

00:05:13.709 --> 00:05:17.964
Exactly. Everyone has a task, a role.

00:05:18.172 --> 00:05:23.719
Lord Artorius showed this to the world.

00:05:23.928 --> 00:05:27.473
A world that trades away someone's life...

00:05:29.433 --> 00:05:31.894
| won't allow it.

00:05:32.103 --> 00:05:39.694
| don't care what happens to this world,
if it was built on my brother's life...

00:05:39.902 --> 00:05:43.531
...I will never tolerate it!

00:05:50.121 --> 00:05:53.583
| suppose you won't be
going back to jail on your own.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.776
Is that...?

00:06:21.777 --> 00:06:22.945
A dragon.

00:06:24.071 --> 00:06:26.532
| have never seen one before either.

00:06:27.617 --> 00:06:28.910
That's...

00:06:33.331 --> 00:06:36.876
But what is a dragon doing here?

00:06:44.634 --> 00:06:46.218
The Daemoneater...

00:06:54.435 --> 00:06:56.395
Incoming! Open fire!

00:07:13.496 --> 00:07:14.956
Damn you, Daemon!

00:07:15.164 --> 00:07:17.708
| don't believe that is also a Daemon.

00:07:17.917 --> 00:07:21.504
It doesn't need your belief. It's just true.

00:07:21.712 --> 00:07:25.800
That creature is what human
malevolence becomes in the end.

00:07:26.008 --> 00:07:28.302
That's why Lord Artorius created this world.

00:07:28.511 --> 00:07:30.012
Your reasons are--!

00:07:30.221 --> 00:07:31.305
Here it comes!

00:07:52.576 --> 00:07:54.704
You monster!

00:07:54.912 --> 00:07:59.417
Do you still rebel against Lord Artorius,
even after seeing this, Seres?!

00:07:59.625 --> 00:08:04.422
| will not live under the protection
of someone else's ideals.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:08.551
| will forge my own path.

00:08:08.759 --> 00:08:13.389
That's laughable, coming from you of all people!

00:08:23.149 --> 00:08:24.734
The remaining ship is...

00:08:28.654 --> 00:08:33.117
Who's the fool that disturbs my sleep?

00:08:34.368 --> 00:08:38.456
Not even an apology?

00:08:42.418 --> 00:08:49.675
What's the matter with you people?
| was having such a nice sleep.

00:08:49.884 --> 00:08:54.096
Definitely a sharp drop... from heaven to hell!

00:08:54.305 --> 00:09:03.022
Or rather, to prison! I thought I got out
of the prison, and now a sinking ship?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.525
You must understand how I feel... Right?

00:09:20.539 --> 00:09:21.874
Listen up!

00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:27.797
| am the great and mighty Grand Sorceress.
Dragons tremble with laughter to hear my name--

00:09:28.005 --> 00:09:30.883
Hey, where are you going?!

00:09:31.884 --> 00:09:34.804
Now is my chance to take the ship and escape.

00:09:35.012 --> 00:09:37.848
If the ship gets destroyed,
there would be no way off of the island.

00:09:38.974 --> 00:09:42.812
Hmm... Oh no, that would be bad!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.647
| call on you, my Malak!

00:09:53.781 --> 00:09:54.990
The barrier!

00:10:05.126 --> 00:10:06.377
Damn it!

00:10:13.259 --> 00:10:14.718
I'll take him on!

00:10:34.238 --> 00:10:41.704
| can't stop here. I can't stop
until I take him down!

00:10:52.923 --> 00:10:54.717
Velvet Crowe.

00:10:54.925 --> 00:11:00.222
There is only one way to escape
this danger and defeat Artorius.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:04.935
| wager my life on you.

00:11:05.144 --> 00:11:06.312
What?

00:11:10.733 --> 00:11:12.568
It's using an Arte?!

00:11:42.264 --> 00:11:44.308
Well, now I'm in a bind.

00:11:45.476 --> 00:11:50.147
Come to think of it, I don't know
how to operate a ship.

00:11:51.148 --> 00:11:54.860
Therefore, I cannot let the dragon eat her.

00:11:59.907 --> 00:12:06.705
I'm Rokurou. I need a ship too,
so I'll lend some help!

00:12:06.914 --> 00:12:10.501
Oh, Rokurou is it? I'm counting on you!

00:12:10.709 --> 00:12:12.419
Listen close!

00:12:12.628 --> 00:12:16.006
| am the Grand Sorceress,

00:12:16.215 --> 00:12:19.677
Magigigika Mirdin Dodin Noruroon Dou!

00:12:19.885 --> 00:12:24.306
Also known as Magilou! Remember that!

00:12:47.371 --> 00:12:49.290
Why?

00:12:49.498 --> 00:12:55.004
To defeat Artorius, you can...

00:12:58.507 --> 00:13:02.177
Please, eat me.

00:13:02.386 --> 00:13:04.930
What are you saying...?

00:13:05.139 --> 00:13:10.811
| am under a Contract that binds
my powers with my own life.

00:13:11.937 --> 00:13:19.111
Eat me, and take my powers.
The power to move on.

00:13:29.371 --> 00:13:31.457
Why would you go so far?

00:13:35.502 --> 00:13:38.505
| have it in my heart too, similar to you.

00:13:38.714 --> 00:13:43.385
A fire that continues to burn,
no matter how hard I try to extinguish it.

00:13:44.595 --> 00:13:46.347
Laphi's comb...

00:13:48.015 --> 00:13:52.019
Please hurry... Before my life ends.

00:13:58.233 --> 00:14:00.694
| give you neither thanks nor apology.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:07.534
There is no need. My wishes are...

00:15:12.516 --> 00:15:16.186
We could be in a bit of trouble.

00:15:58.562 --> 00:16:01.315
That Arte... It can't be!

00:16:02.316 --> 00:16:04.943
Did she eat Seres?!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:27.591
I'm sorry, but I cannot let
a monster like you loose on the world!

00:16:28.675 --> 00:16:30.177
Velvet.

00:16:31.803 --> 00:16:36.058
My name. Make sure Artorius knows.

00:16:36.266 --> 00:16:38.894
|I am Velvet Crowe!

00:16:39.102 --> 00:16:42.814
| will eat all of the Daemons,
Malakim, and Exorcists!

00:16:43.023 --> 00:16:44.525
|I am...

00:16:44.733 --> 00:16:46.151
...the most terrible Daemoneater!

00:17:13.512 --> 00:17:15.597
The wind is coming up.

00:17:16.765 --> 00:17:19.810
Where to, ladies?

00:17:20.018 --> 00:17:27.109
| don't care. I go where the wind
takes me, wander here, wander there.

00:17:27.317 --> 00:17:28.694
Hmm.

00:17:48.046 --> 00:17:54.011
Laphi, do you know why birds fly?

00:18:00.142 --> 00:18:05.772
That's because they won't be able to feed
otherwise. Or escape their enemies.

00:18:07.024 --> 00:18:08.567
| guess so...

00:18:11.361 --> 00:18:16.617
But I also think, birds with wings are...

00:18:17.868 --> 00:18:19.202
Brother...?

00:18:23.123 --> 00:18:24.708
What are you saying...?

00:18:30.005 --> 00:18:32.924
This is the law and order of reality.

00:18:33.133 --> 00:18:37.971
This pain will be stopped
by me, Artorius Collbrande.

00:18:42.059 --> 00:18:45.479
Artorius!

00:18:52.778 --> 00:18:54.780
Head toward the Midgand Region.

00:18:56.448 --> 00:19:00.243
I'm going to the capital, Lawgress.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:08.168
| have no idea how this will turn out,
but that's what makes life interesting.

00:21:26.723 --> 00:21:31.853
Violent winds blow on those standing still

00:21:32.062 --> 00:21:36.149
Those wandering hearts with nowhere to go

00:21:36.358 --> 00:21:41.446
Their righteousness trapped
and endless cries of sorrow,

00:21:41.655 --> 00:21:45.534
Unable to take the next step

00:21:47.953 --> 00:21:57.420
Cast aside the tears clouding your sight

00:21:57.629 --> 00:22:05.303
There's no greater hope
than when leaving the darkness

00:22:05.512 --> 00:22:07.722
Brilliantly it's a brand-new day

00:22:07.931 --> 00:22:10.308
Running past, go ahead the way

00:22:10.517 --> 00:22:15.021
Burn now with unsurpassed life

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.399
Hesitation take it all away

00:22:17.607 --> 00:22:19.985
No matter what happens, just believe your way

00:22:20.193 --> 00:22:25.448
In this field known as the world

00:22:25.657 --> 00:22:30.245
Shine with everything you've got,

00:22:30.453 --> 00:22:38.128
And burn those memories in your mind

00:22:51.057 --> 00:22:54.728
"Next episode preview"

00:22:56.021 --> 00:23:00.775
Why the long face? We're finally free.

00:23:00.984 --> 00:23:03.862
That dragon we faced, it was formidable.

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:05.739
Yeah, I was scared.

00:23:05.947 --> 00:23:08.617
It was quite the destructive force.

00:23:11.036 --> 00:23:14.039
Let's keep our heads up, though!
We're off to travel the world now.

00:23:14.247 --> 00:23:15.415
Right you are.

00:23:15.624 --> 00:23:18.418
Next week's episode is,
"Each One's Feelings."

00:23:18.627 --> 00:23:21.630
Oh? How fitting for this group of ours.

00:23:21.838 --> 00:23:25.842
Yeah. Velvet has hers, I have mine.

00:23:26.051 --> 00:23:31.139
And I have mine as well
as we embark on this new journey!

00:23:31.348 --> 00:23:33.683
Dang! I'm getting excited!

00:23:33.892 --> 00:23:35.644
Let's get this party started!

00:23:35.852 --> 00:23:38.772
Unfortunately, we will not be
appearing on the show.

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:41.358
Seriously?! Why?!

00:23:41.566 --> 00:23:44.569
Then who's coming on the show next week?!

00:23:44.778 --> 00:23:50.867
| don't know. But that person
must have his or her own thoughts, too.
